WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.133
This video shows Manage Activities, the manager's view of all open work:

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:12.122
how to filter the activities, and how to reassign, reschedule, re-prioritize, move or

00:00:12.122 --> 00:00:14.820
purge many of them with one action.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.694
Plans change.

00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:26.326
An agent is away, a campaign is cancelled, or a list needs to be called first.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:30.080
Opening activities one at a time would take hours.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.843
Manage Activities shows every open activity, whoever owns it, and lets you filter

00:00:35.843 --> 00:00:38.320
it down to exactly the ones you want.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:43.299
Then one action changes all of them, and it never touches a call

00:00:43.299 --> 00:00:44.930
that is already live.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:53.234
Open Interaction Center, Management, Manage Activities.

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:56.729
Every open activity is listed, not only yours.

00:00:56.729 --> 00:01:01.839
Each row shows whether it is manual or automated work, its source, the

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:04.663
campaign, and who it is assigned to.

00:01:05.115 --> 00:01:07.176
Open the filter panel.

00:01:07.176 --> 00:01:09.973
Contact filters find the people:

00:01:09.973 --> 00:01:16.082
their status, phone number, time zones, or when they were marked Do not call.

00:01:16.082 --> 00:01:18.952
Activity filters narrow the work:

00:01:18.952 --> 00:01:28.152
attempts, subject, channel, source, interaction type, status, assignment, campaign, urgency, dates, owners and a limit.

00:01:28.152 --> 00:01:32.715
Here, the subject Test Drive Follow-up and High urgency.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.780
Tick the activities you want on the page.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.490
Here, two sales calls.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.391
Pick an action.

00:01:44.391 --> 00:01:48.461
Assign shares activities between users and resets them.

00:01:48.461 --> 00:01:50.729
Reschedule moves their date.

00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:52.998
Purge removes them for good.

00:01:52.998 --> 00:01:57.802
Set Instructions and Set Urgency Level change what the agent sees.

00:01:57.802 --> 00:02:03.673
Change Subject, Clear Assignment, Change Source and Change Campaign move the work.

00:02:03.673 --> 00:02:07.610
Here, Set Urgency Level to High, then Execute Action.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:12.926
To act on every result of the filter, including other pages, tick Apply

00:02:12.926 --> 00:02:15.011
to all matching activities.

00:02:15.011 --> 00:02:18.550
Here, every sales call gets the same instructions.

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.248
Change Source sets the source to Manual or Automatic.

00:02:26.248 --> 00:02:30.693
It also has an Interaction type selector, to keep the current type or

00:02:30.693 --> 00:02:33.065
make the work manual or automated.

00:02:33.065 --> 00:02:37.510
By default it clears the assignment, so the work can be routed again.

00:02:37.962 --> 00:02:42.674
Purge marks the activities purged with your name and the time, and it

00:02:42.674 --> 00:02:46.192
cannot be undone, so it asks you to confirm first.

00:02:50.392 --> 00:02:54.936
An activity the dialer is dialing, ringing an agent with, or that an

00:02:54.936 --> 00:03:00.094
agent is on a call for is left unchanged by every bulk action, Purge included.

00:03:00.094 --> 00:03:05.252
The message says how many, so you can run the action again when the calls end.

00:03:06.002 --> 00:03:10.855
With the outbound dialer on, Change Dialer Profile appears as a tenth action.

00:03:10.855 --> 00:03:15.532
It turns assigned work into dialer work, and moving dialer work to another

00:03:15.532 --> 00:03:18.222
campaign moves its dialer queue with it.

00:03:18.972 --> 00:03:24.267
A campaign's waiting dialer activities must all use one dialer profile, so move

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:26.822
one profile's activities at a time.

00:03:31.022 --> 00:03:35.272
Reassign an absent agent's activities to the rest of the team.

00:03:36.022 --> 00:03:39.842
Raise the urgency of everything for one campaign.

00:03:40.592 --> 00:03:45.372
Move activities to a new subject or campaign when plans change.

00:03:46.122 --> 00:03:51.262
Purge work that is no longer needed, after a filter shows exactly what it is.

00:03:53.262 --> 00:03:57.763
Filter to exactly the activities you mean, pick one action, and apply it

00:03:57.763 --> 00:04:02.206
to the selection or to every match, so a change of plan takes a minute.

00:04:02.206 --> 00:04:06.591
The user manual and the technical guide are linked in the description.

00:04:06.591 --> 00:04:08.092
Thanks for watching.

